# code-is-decision-two — F4 silent-omission coverage fixture.
library "Code Is Decision Two".

// A decision-bearing library that `when`s on TWO `code is` boolean concepts, so
// the case-feature emit produces TWO StructureDefinitions AND the decision emit
// must attach TWO action-level `input` profiles (one per when-action). This
// covers the "SD emitted but input dropped" direction Inv 5 does not — Inv 5
// validates that any emitted input.profile resolves to an SD, not that every
// emitted SD's concept also got an input.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult-18-or-older`.

concept "Active Crohns Disease":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `active-crohns-disease`.

activity "Refer to GI":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage Crohns":
- when "Adult Patient" then:
  - when "Active Crohns Disease" then recommend activity "Refer to GI".
  end.
